        "content": "## Setup before first run\n1. Create a Google spreadsheet with two tabs: **Candidates** and **Generated**.\n2. In Candidates, use these headers: candidateId, selected, status, productIdea, opportunityScore, decision, copyrightRisk, trademarkRisk, platformPolicyRisk, reason, saferAlternative, visibleText, amazonUrl, asin, originalTitle.\n3. In Generated, use these headers: candidateId, status, generatedAt, newConcept, newSlogan, imagePrompt, title, brand, bullet1, bullet2, description, backendKeywords.\n4. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in both Google Sheets nodes.\n5. Select your Google Sheets credential in both Sheets nodes.\n6. Select your OpenAI credential in the AI nodes and HTTP Request node.\n7. In Candidates set exactly one row's selected value to TRUE, then execute this workflow.\n8. The generated PNG is available in the Convert Image to Binary node under binary property `design`.",
